---

---

<section id="section-hero" class="h-svh">
  <div class="bg-neutral-950 size-full relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- multimedia -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img
        src="/assets/cover_mobile_o.webp"
        alt=""
        class="size-full object-cover opacity-40 lg:hidden"
      />
      <video
        class="hidden lg:block size-full object-cover opacity-40"
        src="/assets/video.webm"
        poster="/assets/cover_o.webp"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline></video>
    </div>
    <!-- overlay -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900 opacity-50"></div>
    <!-- content -->
    <div
      class="relative size-full text-white flex flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-10 gap-10 | lg:container lg:mx-auto lg:max-w-330 lg:px-0 lg:pb-30"
    >
      <!-- first -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 | lg:flex-row justify-between">
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:w-175 lg:text-6xl">
          Tu empresa es sólida. Tu presencia digital también debería serlo.
        </h1>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 | lg:w-90 lg:justify-end lg:gap-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs text-orange-200/90 hidden lg:block">
            • SOMOS OCTALINK
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm">
            No vendemos páginas web, somos tu equipo de infraestructura digital.
            Nos encargamos de que todo funcione siempre — suscripción mensual
            fija sin costos ocultos.
          </p>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Clientes</a>
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-white">Agenda una llamada</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px]">
        MOVE WITH INTENTION. LIVE WITH MORE EASE.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

